    "description": "Developed scalable and efficient Microservices architecture using Spring Boot and Spring MVC pattern.\nDesigned and implemented JPA Entities and Repositories with DAOs for efficient data access to the database.\nDeveloped reusable modules and custom directives in Angular and utilized them throughout the application.\nImplemented secure REST services using OAuth 2.0 for user authentication and security.\nContributed to testing and production support of a core Java-based multithreading ETL tool for distributed loading of XML data into the database.\nMentored junior developers in design patterns, best practices, and coding standards, ensuring their professional growth.\nImplemented advanced search and logging features using Elasticsearch, Kibana, and Logstash for robust and reliable logging of system events.\nConfigured S3 buckets for storage and deployed RESTful web services on AWS EC2 instances.\nParticipated in various phases of Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) such as requirements gathering, analysis, design, and development.\nExpertise in Spring Bean wiring, Spring DAO, and Spring AOP modules for better application performance and maintainability.",
