  "about": "As an experienced Java developer with over 9 years of experience in healthcare and federal clients, I specialize in creating microservices using Spring Boot, JDK8+ Streams, functional programming, and REST services. I have expertise in deploying microservices in Docker and Amazon EC2 containers using AWS, and am proficient in UI design using JavaScript, Reactstrap4, React, Redux, Router, and Node.js, Npm.\n\nMy experience also includes RDBMS implementation and development using Oracle, MySQL, MSSQL, and DB2, as well as cloud computing services like Amazon Web Services (EC2, EBS, S3, and Elasticsearch). I have proficiency in DevOps operations using automated GitLab pipelines for CI/CD, Artifactory for centralized repository, and Docker containers and OpenShift platform for automatic builds and deployments.\n\nI am familiar with Agile (SCRUM) and Test-Driven Development (TDD) development methodologies and have experience working with JBoss, WebLogic Application Server, IBM WebSphere Application, and Apache Tomcat. Additionally, I possess excellent problem-solving skills and have the ability to work effectively in a team, with strong communication skills to communicate effectively with technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIf you are interested in discussing my skills and experience further, please feel free to connect with me.",
